Q1. Write a python program to accept value of radius from user and calculate the area of a circle using function. (Use 3.14 as π)

[10 Marks]

# Q1 Solution

def area_of_circle(radius):
    return 3.14 * radius * radius

r = float(input("Enter radius: "))

area = area_of_circle(r)

print("Area of circle =", area)


