Q2. Write a python program to create a list, string and tuple in python. Apply random module to display unique multiple random elements from above created sequence type.

[20 Marks]

# Q2 Solution

import random

# Create sequence types
my_list = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
my_string = "HELLOPYTHON"
my_tuple = (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6)

# Random unique elements
print("Random elements from list:")
print(random.sample(my_list, 3))

print("\nRandom elements from string:")
print(random.sample(my_string, 4))

print("\nRandom elements from tuple:")
print(random.sample(my_tuple, 3))


